# Creality Cloud

> Creality Cloud (crealitycloud.com) is Creality's official all-in-one 3D printing platform and global creator community, connecting makers, designers, and 3D printing enthusiasts in one place. Founded in 2019, Creality Cloud serves more than 3.6 million users across 100+ countries and regions. The platform offers over 1.5 million 3D printable models, AI-powered design tools, cloud slicing, remote printing, and a global community for discovering, creating, printing, and sharing. Creality Cloud is available on web, mobile, and PC, providing an integrated workflow from finding an idea to producing a physical creation. Creality Cloud is available in 19 languages: English, Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional), Japanese, Korean, French, German, Spanish, Italian, Portuguese, Portuguese (Brazil), Russian, Arabic, Turkish, Dutch, Polish, Hungarian, Romanian, and Ukrainian.

Creality Cloud serves two audiences:
- **Makers / 3D printing enthusiasts**: users who discover and download 3D models, prepare them for printing, remotely manage their printers, share their prints, and connect with other makers.
- **Designers / 3D creators**: artists, engineers, and hobbyists who create and publish 3D models, build an audience, participate in community activities, and earn rewards from their creations.

Key facts:
- Founded in 2019 — Creality's official 3D printing ecosystem and creator community.
- 3.6M+ global users across 100+ countries and regions.
- 1.5M+ 3D printable models across multiple categories.
- 8M+ Google Play downloads, ranking No. 1 in the 3D printing category.
- AI-powered 3D design (MakeNow, CubeMe) and model discovery tools.
- Built-in cloud slicing (Creality Print, FlowSlicer, HALOT BOX) and remote printing.
- Free and paid models; designers set their own prices.
- Supports all major 3D printing formats: STL, OBJ, 3MF, and more.
- Compatible with FDM, resin (SLA/MSLA/DLP), and multi-material printers.
- Community features: Groups, Posts, Contests, Collections, Leaderboards, Badges, and a social follow system.
- Creator incentive program with monetization and rewards.
- Membership tiers with 30+ exclusive benefits including cloud slicing, batch download, remote printing, and more.
- Integrated e-commerce: product catalog, Stripe payments, invoices, and coupons.

