## Designer Profiles

Each designer on Creality Cloud has a public profile page with multiple tabs. The URL pattern is `https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/`:

- [Profile Tab](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/profile): User's basic information, bio, and avatar.
- [Models Tab](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/model): All 3D models published by the designer.
- [Model Folders](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/model-folder): Organized folders of the designer's models.
- [Likes Tab](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/likes): Models the designer has liked.
- [Community Tab](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/community): The designer's community posts and activity.
- [Follows Tab](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/follows): Users the designer is following.
- [Favorites Folders](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/favorites-folder): The designer's saved/favorited model folders.
- [Print Record](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/print-record): History of 3D prints initiated by the user.
- [Cloud Storage](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/cloud-storage): User's cloud-stored files and models.
- [Time-Lapse](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/time-lapse): Time-lapse videos captured during printing.
- [Wallet](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/wallet): User's earnings, balance, and transaction history.
- [Purchased](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/purchased): Models and content the user has purchased.
- [Boost](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/boost): Model promotion and boost management.
- [Drafts](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/draft): Unpublished model drafts.
- [Member Record](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user/{id}/member-record): Membership subscription history.
- [User Center](https://www.crealitycloud.com/user-center/{userId}): Alternative user center view with account overview.
- [Personal Center](https://www.crealitycloud.com/personal-center): Personal dashboard and quick access to key features.

